 "description": "The Tone+FX suite as one elemod: master ring modulator (digiring), a low-shelf/high-shelf master EQ (digieq), a wavefolder with a continuous CLEAN/MUD/DIST/TRSH fold type and an internal hard-clip overdrive on DIST/TRSH (digifold), output meter (digimeter) and the DIGI RING / DIGI FOLD / DIGI TILT master pages with all their controls (digictl), plus the TONE+FX boot splash (tonesplash: an animated wordmark drawn at the intro, one of three animations per boot). Settings are stored per pattern and the FX respond to incoming MIDI CC. It REQUIRES the core (core-dn1) and does not include it, so it combines with any other elekloader mods.",
